<section image-layout="blank" id="EThfByRrhr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="P8HoKmLRhP" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Leadership QBR · A quarter in motion</p><h1 font-size="42pt">Growth continued.<br/>Expansion weakened.</h1><h3 role="subheading">Acquisition and efficiency improved, but the customer-expansion engine lost ground.</h3><spacer mode="fixed" size="16pt"></spacer><grid divider="sm palette-5" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Acquire</h4><h3 font-size="26pt">$24.8M</h3><p font-size="16pt">Revenue · up 6%</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Deliver</h4><h3 font-size="26pt">61%</h3><p font-size="16pt">Margin · up 2 points</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Expand</h4><h3 font-size="26pt"><span text-color="accent">108%</span></h3><p font-size="16pt">Retention · down 2 points</p></grid-item></grid><spacer mode="fixed" size="16pt"></spacer><p font-size="18pt"><b>Decision required:</b> fund onboarding, enforce the pricing guardrail, and shift two open roles toward expansion.</p><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p font-size="13pt"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p></grid-item><grid-item id="8HFUYab1YD" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.18" vertical-align="end" padding="20pt" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/Q6cCHfTPsP56tm5XrlSiY.png" saved-media-id="ovvq2t6qen9thw8" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="causal-model-studio" alt="Editorial studio photograph of a functional tabletop growth system assembled from matte warm-white card and machined aluminum, several rails converging on a narrow expansion gate marked by one signal-red intervention lever, restrained green details showing value moving through the system, graphite background, crisp directional light, no text, lettering, screens, logos, or people." meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:16